> unlimited wands of teleport (about 15 with 6 charges each)

This is an interesting assumption; and it seem not valid for my own
games. YMMV. First, where did you get that "unlimited wands" from?
Even 15 is an exceptionally huge value, IME. Then, you might find it
a good idea to use wands of teleport in Gehennom, and I understand
