wands of teleportation is significantly smaller; more something like
2-10. And I find it a good idea to save at least 3 such wands for
the Astral Plane.

In my own games I get teleporation primarily from other sources; one
are scrolls (depending on the actual game about 10-30 scrolls), and
very often from [controlled] teleportitis.

> unlimited wands of digging (less than 10 needed)

If you shortcut the paths on your way down (with a pickaxe) you only
need a few wands of digging if the Force places you in nowhere-land.

